s/thunderbird/icedove/g;
s/Thunderbird/Icedove/g;
s/THUNDERBIRD/ICEDOVE/g;
s/ Mozilla / Trisquel /g;
s/Firefox/Abrowser/g;
s|PACKAGES/icedove|PACKAGES/thunderbird|g;
